  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_first_00",
      "hash64": "C9ED51AC91ECBCD6",
      "text": "……呜呜，好冷。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_first_01",
      "hash64": "C9ED52AC91ECBE89",
      "text": "这里的空调也太冷了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "D186977D9003E0F6",
      "text": "你把我叫来这里……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "D186987D9003E2A9",
      "text": "可是一件很尴冷的事……\\n你知道吗？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "D186957D9003DD90",
      "text": "我不觉得把我叫来\\n会对学园有好处。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "16E2870749937938",
      "text": "没那回事！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "16E28A0749937E51",
      "text": "嗯……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "D186967D9003DF43",
      "text": "……说得这么肯定，\\n那份自信是从哪里来的呀？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_03b",
      "hash64": "0B90D85BB6942513",
      "text": "你看……\\n你不也是没有自信嘛。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "D1869B7D9003E7C2",
      "text": "但既然来了，\\n我还是会完成工作的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "D1869C7D9003E975",
      "text": "姑且……\\n我也是专业的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "A2B0996582B268A9",
      "text": "……是你啊？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "A2B0986582B266F6",
      "text": "你去过巨蛋的极地区吗？\\n那里真厉害呀。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "A2B0976582B26543",
      "text": "那里的雪软得就像是天然的一样，\\n让人难以相信是人工雪。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "A2B0966582B26390",
      "text": "直道和弯道都很充足，\\n非常适合单板滑雪。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "0A146F6F18BACCD5",
      "text": "你要滑雪吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "0A146C6F18BAC7BC",
      "text": "去滑雪吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "A2B09D6582B26F75",
      "text": "……啊，\\n我不是这个意思。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "A2B09C6582B26DC2",
      "text": "只是我改不掉看到雪山\\n就会开始观察的毛病。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "A2B09B6582B26C0F",
      "text": "居然在校内造出那样的山……\\n这里真是个不得了的地方。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "4DD3636F921AA518",
      "text": "刚刚我去登了\\n极地区的雪山。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "4DD3646F921AA6CB",
      "text": "在不是霜抹的雪山上，\\n走鲸们玩得可兴奋了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "4DD3656F921AA87E",
      "text": "看着看着，我也……\\n忍不住……玩了一下单板滑雪。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "3172AE49C79029EC",
      "text": "真好！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "3172AD49C7902839",
      "text": "感觉怎么样？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "4DD3666F921AAA31",
      "text": "呃，雪的状态很好哦。\\n嗯……很好。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "4DD3676F921AABE4",
      "text": "这次久违的滑雪\\n让我兴奋过头了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "4DD3686F921AAD97",
      "text": "虽然我之前都不打算\\n再踏上滑雪板了……[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "4DD3696F921AAF4A",
      "text": "但至少到这里来时，\\n还是可以解除这个限制吧？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "C361CA51FA0A3C12",
      "text": "……抱歉，\\n我的意志力这么薄弱。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "C361CB51FA0A3DC5",
      "text": "我们来做些冷上加冷的事吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "C361C851FA0A38AC",
      "text": "你要和我来\\n进行宝可梦交换吗？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "C361C951FA0A3A5F",
      "text": "真的要来交换吗？\\n那么我就用走鲸跟你换吧。\\r\\n你会用哪只来换呢？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "C361C651FA0A3546",
      "text": "是[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊。\\n嗯……不错。\\c\\n既然它是你托付给我的，\\n那我是不会用尴冷的方法培育它的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "15DC0C363F15BBE5",
      "text": "那么就用我的走鲸来和\\n你的[VAR 0x0101(0001)]交换咯。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_02_01",
      "hash64": "15DC0B363F15BA32",
      "text": "无法使用初训家不是自己的\\n宝可梦进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_02_02",
      "hash64": "15DC0A363F15B87F",
      "text": "无法使用稀有宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_02_03",
      "hash64": "15DC09363F15B6CC",
      "text": "无法使用异色宝可梦\\n进行交换。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_trade_03_00",
      "hash64": "EAF1964188228434",
      "text": "只有１只宝可梦的话太尴冷了，\\n无法进行交换。\\c\\n同行的宝可梦至少要\\n带上２只才行。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
