    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_win_00_00",
      "hash64": "BED50689952D5CFF",
      "text": "……我输得五体投地。\\n现实真是冰冷啊。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "BED50589952D5B4C",
      "text": "但我打得十分开心，\\n算是有所收获吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_win_00_02",
      "hash64": "BED50889952D6065",
      "text": "这是败者送给胜者的，\\n你拿去吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_win_00_03",
      "hash64": "BED50789952D5EB2",
      "text": "你不要的话就扔掉吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
