    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "153AD19130971F21",
      "text": "下次再战的时候，\\n我不会让结果尴冷的。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "3899A1DFB3C87326",
      "text": "就算打赢放水的你，\\n我也一点都高兴不起来。\\r\\n下次你可要全力以赴哦。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_00",
      "hash64": "EBF1DF29191CA9D5",
      "text": "我不擅长跟学生相处……\\n一想到他们将来可能会遇到挫折，\\r\\n我就不忍直视了。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "EBF1DE29191CA822",
      "text": "我在这边似乎\\n也有一点名气。\\c\\n但会来要求合照的人\\n有你一个就够了啊。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "EBF1DD29191CA66F",
      "text": "我还是觉得这里的空调\\n温度是不是调得太低了？\\r\\n要跟谁说才能调高温度呢？[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "EBF1DC29191CA4BC",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]过得很好哦。\\n它和我的宝可梦相处得很不错。\\r\\n……目前为止它并不尴冷。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "EBF1DB29191CA309",
      "text": "交换给你的\\n走鲸现在过得怎么样？\\c\\n它马上就会跑到别的地方去，\\n在野餐时记得要好好看着它。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "coach_gym_koori_randomtalk_sp",
      "hash64": "EB1BA52918668C5E",
      "text": "……说起来，也慈她\\n告诉了我一件尴冷的事。\\c\\n据说你跟她说\\n你最喜欢的道馆馆主是我。\\c\\n虽然我完全不能理解你到底是\\n怎样得出这个答案的……\\c\\n但你的心意我知道了……\\n姑且跟你说声谢谢吧。[VAR 0x0114(001A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
